  "steps": [
    "Brown the ground beef in a large pot over medium-high heat, breaking it up as it cooks.",
    "Add the diced onion and bell pepper, cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste and taco seasoning, cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, green chilies, all the beans, corn, and water.",
    "Bring to a simmer and cook uncovered for 30-40 minutes, stirring occasionally, until thickened.",
    "Serve with your choice of avocado, jalapeño, cilantro, cheese, or sour cream."
